#
# File: 230-ARP-Announcement-req-in-monitor.rule
# Policy: Monitor RFC 5227 ARP announcement candidates for the zone interface address
# Description:
#     Runs after ARP hook and zone interface map/vmap dispatch; no interface matching here.
#     An announcement request uses equal sender and target IPv4 addresses.
#     Direction: remote-to-local; intended for arp input hook.
#
arp operation request arp saddr ip $DEVICE_INTF_ADDR arp daddr ip $DEVICE_INTF_ADDR counter comment "remote-to-local Announcement req monitor"
